(  STRING EDITING COMMANDS                        WFR-79MAR24 ) : 1LINE       ( SCAN LINE WITH CURSOR FOR MATCH TO PAD TEXT, *)                              ( UPDATE CURSOR, RETURN BOOLEAN *)        #LAG  PAD  COUNT  MATCH  R#   +!   ;                                                                                     :  FIND   ( STRING AT PAD OVER FULL SCREEN RANGE, ELSE ERROR *)      BEGIN  3FF  R#  @  <                                                IF  TOP  PAD  HERE  C/L  1+  CMOVE  0  ERROR  ENDIF             1LINE   UNTIL   ;                                                                                                      : DELETE                    ( BACKWARDS AT CURSOR BY COUNT-1 *)     >R  #LAG  +  FORTH  R  -  ( SAVE BLANK FILL LOCATION )          #LAG  R MINUS  R#  +!     ( BACKUP CURSOR )                     #LEAD  +  SWAP  CMOVE                                           R>  BLANKS  UPDATE  ;   ( FILL FROM END OF TEXT )           -->                                                             